 Candidate A.\n\nProvide evidence: anticipate dangerous situations, see complex connections, excellent spatial vision, very good leadership. Concerns: show-off, not open to new ideas.\n\nExplain why still best: strengths directly support safety-critical tasks, while concerns are manageable.\n\nProvide vote.\n\nProceed."}
